<h2>Desktops</h2>
<p>Desktop Macs range from the M6's 12-core GPU in the Mac mini and the M4's 10-core GPU in the iMac up to the M5 Ultra's 80-core GPU in the Mac Studio. The M5 Max is the sweet spot for serious gaming — its 40-core GPU reaches 20.5 TFLOPS on 614 GB/s of bandwidth, while the M5 Ultra doubles both.</p>

